window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>\"I should have known that going to Vegas with Astra would cause more problems than it solved, but I never imagined that her latest scheme would completely change my life.\" </p> <p>Senator's daughter, Piety Van Allen, wakes up in Las Vegas with no memory of the previous night's escapades. Not only does she find a naked stranger in her bed, but when she learns that she's now married to the handsome Australian stripper from Flames Down Under, panic erupts. </p> <p>However, her best friend, Astra, comes up with a plan that could solve everything...or cause even more problems. </p> <p>Don't miss <i>Married a Stripper</i>, MS Parker and Cassie Wild's latest stand-alone romance. </p>"; 
